		<description><![CDATA[<p>German Amazon, Dutch Bol.com and Danish Music.dk launched an exclusive pre-sale of Madonna&#8217;s next tour tickets. Just pre-order Rebel Heart [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/exclusive-pre-sale-for-madonnas-next-world-tour-with-rebel-heart-pre-order/20150220">Exclusive pre-sale for Madonna&#8217;s next world tour with Rebel Heart pre-order</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>German Amazon</strong>, <strong>Dutch Bol.com</strong> and <strong>Danish Music.dk</strong> launched an exclusive pre-sale of <strong>Madonna&#8217;s next tour</strong> tickets. Just pre-order <strong>Rebel Heart</strong> and you will be the first to get access on ticket sale.</p>
<p>This means that we are very close to an official announcement for <strong>Madonna&#8217;s next world tour</strong>.</p>
<p>If you pre-order <strong>Rebel Heart</strong> on <strong>Amazon.de</strong> before 5 March, you will receive an email on Saturday, 7 March, with all details to purchase your tickets in advance for one of the German dates.</p>
<p>Same if you pre-order <strong>Rebel Heart</strong> on <strong>Dutch Bol.com</strong> before March 4, you will receive an email on March 5 with a link to the exclusive tickets&#8217; presale for the concerts in Holland and/or Belgium.</p>
<p>Similar in <strong>Denmark</strong>, if you pre-order <strong>Rebel Heart</strong>, you will get the access to an exclusive ticket presale for a show in <strong>Denmark.</strong></p>
<p>More nations to be added&#8230;.</p>
<p>Are you excited?</p>
