				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>On the occasion of the release of her new album <strong>Rebel Heart</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> gave an interview to Maxime Switek at <strong><a href="http://www.europe1.fr/radio/articles/madonne-invitee-exceptionnelle-d-europe-1-le-27-fevrier-2374673" target="_blank">Europe 1</a>. </strong>It will be aired on <strong>February 27</strong> at <strong>7.45 AM</strong>. Here&#8217;s their presentation of the interview:</p>
<p><em>Madonna is the best selling female artist worldwide. Winner of the most prestigious awards (Grammy Awards, 30 MTV Awards, 39 Billboard Awards&#8230;).</em><br />
<em>During this special interview, Madonna will discuss the new collaborations on this album with OneRepublic&#8217;s Ryan Tedder and Avicii. It will review the problems with this album (especially her anger after leakage), the world tour that she is currently preparing (with several <strong>Bercy dates</strong>, probably in <strong>Autumn 2015</strong>) and she will speak on the attacks at Charlie Hebdo that took place in Paris in early January.</em></p>
