				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Iggy Azalea recently spoke with <a href="http://www.gq.com/entertainment/music/201502/iggy-azalea-interview-grammys" target="_blank">GQ</a> and shared details of her upcoming arena tour, including the fact that she&#8217;s taking inspiration from <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s <strong>Confessions Tour</strong>.</p>
<blockquote><p>One tour I really love that I didn&#8217;t go to, unfortunately, was the <span style="color: #800080;"><strong>Madonna Confessions tour</strong>. <strong>I love that tour so much</strong></span>. It was actually why I called up Jamie King, who&#8217;s working on the tour with me&#8211;because he left Madonna&#8217;s tour. I was like, &#8216;I&#8217;ve gotta have the people that were involved in creating this.&#8217; I love when the stage changes and transforms.</p></blockquote>
